-#
  `PlantSightingsController#identify` shu partial'ni IKKI kontekstда ham
  render qiladi: wizard 4-qadami (edit_plant.html.haml) va ekspert
  moderatsiyasi (pending.html.haml, 2b-bosqich) — shuning uchun "Tanlash"
  tugmasida IKKALA JS fayl uchun ham class/data bor: `sighting-identify-
  select-btn` (wizard, plant_sighting_identify.js) va `moderation-
  identify-select-btn` (moderatsiya, moderate_plant_sighting_identify.js)
  — har biri faqat o'z sahifasida mavjud ota elementni topgani uchun,
  boshqa sahifada handler harakatsiz qoladi (xato bermaydi).
- identify_scope = 'plant_sightings.edit.identify'
- if @identify_error_message.present?
  .sighting-identify-error= @identify_error_message
- elsif @predictions.blank?
  .sighting-identify-empty= I18n.t('no_results', scope: identify_scope)
- else
  %p.sighting-identify-disclaimer= I18n.t('disclaimer', scope: identify_scope)
  .sighting-identify-predictions
    - @predictions.each do |prediction|
      .sighting-identify-prediction
        .sighting-identify-prediction-row
          %span.sighting-identify-prediction-name
            %i= prediction.scientific_name
          %span.sighting-identify-prediction-score= "#{prediction.score_percent}%"
        - if prediction.common_name.present?
          %p.sighting-identify-prediction-common= prediction.common_name
        .sighting-identify-score-bar
          .sighting-identify-score-bar-fill{ style: "width: #{prediction.score_percent}%;" }
        - if prediction.plant
          .sighting-identify-prediction-actions
            %button.sighting-identify-select-btn.moderation-identify-select-btn{ type: 'button', data: { plant_id: prediction.plant.id, selected_text: "#{prediction.plant.display_name(I18n.locale)} | #{prediction.plant.species_sci}", sci: prediction.plant.species_sci } }
              = I18n.t('select', scope: identify_scope)
            = link_to I18n.t('view_profile', scope: identify_scope), plant_path(prediction.plant), target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener noreferrer', class: 'sighting-identify-profile-link'
